YARA catalogs (data/catalogs/yara/).

yara-x-modules.json is the module reflection of YARA-X 1.23.0 (VirusTotal/yara-x,
the yara-x crate's `mods::reflect` over its default modules), printed by
scripts/engine/yara-modules: member names, types, function signatures and
documentation. Copyright (c) 2024 The YARA-X Authors, BSD 3-Clause License
(LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause-YARA-X.txt).

modules.toml is generated from it by `cargo xtask codegen`
(xtask/src/yara_modules.rs), less the modules opentide excludes (`vt`). Names,
types and signatures are reformatted; documentation strings are copied as
YARA-X publishes them.

Until #1225, modules.toml also read the module declarations of libyara 4.5.4
(VirusTotal/yara, libyara/modules/*/*.c). Copyright (c) 2007-2016 The YARA
Authors, BSD 3-Clause License (LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause-libyara.txt, which also
covers the parts of libyara crates/opentide-yara follows).

language.toml is written for this repository from the opentide YARA
language spec (yara-1.0) and the HarfangLab and Bitdefender platform specs.
